  "name": null,
  "problem": "Find the moment of inertia ${I}_{y}$ of this plate about the $y$-axis.\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${I}_{y}\\,=$\n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}",
  "worked_solution": "For a plane lamina $D$ with mass density function $\\lambda (x,y),$ the moment of inertia about the $y$-axis is given by\n\n$$\n{I}_{y}={\u222c}_{D}{x}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula for ${I}_{y},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{I}_{y} & ={\u222c}_{D}{x}^{2}\\lambda (x,y)\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\u222c}_{D}{x}^{2}\\cdot 2x{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\u222c}_{D}2{x}^{3}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}{\\int }_{0}^{3}2{x}^{3}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}2{y}^{2}{[\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{4}]}_{x=0}^{x=3}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}2{y}^{2}(\\frac{81}{4}-0)\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{2}\\frac{81}{2}{y}^{2}\\,\\text{d}y \\\\  & ={[\\frac{27}{2}{y}^{3}]}_{y=0}^{y=2} \\\\  & =\\frac{27}{2}({2}^{3}-0) \\\\  & =108.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
